### PoMemeVideo — Ingestion API

@baseUrl = https://localhost:5001

### 1. Generate SAS token for video upload (mp4)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ingestion/sas
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "fileName": "my-video.mp4",
    "fileSizeBytes": 104857600
}

###

### 2. Generate SAS token for video upload (webm)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ingestion/sas
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "fileName": "clip.webm",
    "fileSizeBytes": 52428800
}

###

### 3. Generate SAS — invalid extension (expect 400 INVALID_EXTENSION)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ingestion/sas
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "fileName": "exploit.exe",
    "fileSizeBytes": 1024
}

###

### 4. Generate SAS — file too large (expect 400 FILE_TOO_LARGE)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ingestion/sas
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "fileName": "huge.mp4",
    "fileSizeBytes": 600000000
}

###

### 5. Confirm session after upload
# Replace {{sessionId}} with a value returned from request #1
@sessionId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ingestion/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "sessionId": "{{sessionId}}",
    "blobPath": "sessions/{{sessionId}}/source.mp4",
    "videoDurationSeconds": 42.5,
    "aggressiveVisuals": true
}

###

### 6. Get session status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ingestion/sessions/{{sessionId}}

###
